              <infoLinks>
                <infoLink name="Psyker" id="b9281f81-367a-51e3-e310-79018feffcb8" hidden="false" targetId="eafb54a8-e9b7-8cd0-8d0e-0fd364bf4873" type="rule"/>
              </infoLinks>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Psychic Powers" id="fa07-cf18-8e89-613c" hidden="false">
                  <description>Dominion - WC 1 : Dominion is a blessing that targets the Psyker. Whilst this power is in effect the Psyker adds 6&quot; to its synapse range. If the Psyker doesn&apos;t have the Synapse Creature special rule, it gains it for the duration of this power and has a synapse range of 6&quot;.

The Horror - WC 1 : A malediction that targets a single enemy unit within 24”. The target must immediately take a Pinning test (as described for the Pinning special rule in the Warhammer 40,000 rulebook) with a -2 modifier to their Leadership.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
