                <rule name="Objective Secured" id="16b93f6a-7a7c-e105-f9cc-ea96bbfea9ca" hidden="false" publicationId="f2f40acf--pubN78162">
                  <description>All Gargoyle units from this Formation have the Objective Secured special rule. A unit with this special rule controls Objective Markers even if an enemy scoring unit is within range of the Objective Marker, unless the enemy unit also has this special rule.</description>
