    <profile name="Acid Blood" id="5858d95c-32e4-fd1c-e4f3-3b7a5327dbf8" hidden="false" page="67" publicationId="f2f40acf--pubN65999" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">For each unsaved Wound a model with the acid blood biomorph suffers in close combat, the enemy unit that inflicted the Wound must take an Initiative test at the end of the current Initiative step. For each test that is failed, the unit that inflicted the Wound immediately suffers a Strength 5 AP2 hit with the Ignores Cover special rule.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
